{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"721","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Journey"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Recently Irina arrived to one of the most famous cities of Berland — the Berlatov city. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" showplaces in the city, numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", and some of them are connected by one-directional roads. The roads in Berlatov are designed in a way such that there "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"are no"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" cyclic routes between showplaces."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially Irina stands at the showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":", and the endpoint of her journey is the showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". Naturally, Irina wants to visit as much showplaces as she can during her journey. However, Irina's stay in Berlatov is limited and she can't be there for more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" time units."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Irina determine how many showplaces she may visit during her journey from showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" within a time not exceeding "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":". It is guaranteed that there is at least one route from showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that Irina will spend no more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" time units passing it."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n, m"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 5000,  1 ≤ m ≤ 5000,  1 ≤ T ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of showplaces, the number of roads between them and the time of Irina's stay in Berlatov respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describes roads in Berlatov. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ui, vi, ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ui, vi ≤ n, ui ≠ vi, 1 ≤ ti ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":"), meaning that there is a road starting from showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ui"},{"kind":"text","text":" and leading to showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vi"},{"kind":"text","text":", and Irina spends "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" time units to pass it. It is guaranteed that the roads do not form cyclic routes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed, that there is at most one road between each pair of showplaces."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ k ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the maximum number of showplaces that Irina can visit during her journey from showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to showplace "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" within time not exceeding "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":", in the first line."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" distinct integers in the second line — indices of showplaces that Irina will visit on her route, in the order of encountering them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple answers, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3 13\n1 2 5\n2 3 7\n2 4 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n1 2 4 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 6 7